OL,4,CFurther walkout planned by NI doctors  
OL,5,Cas strike ends                         
OL,6,GA 24-hour strike by resident doctors   
OL,7,Gin Northern Ireland held as part of an 
OL,8,Gongoing dispute over pay has ended,    
OL,9,Gbut fresh action will begin on Monday. 
OL,11,FConsultants and specialist doctors     
OL,12,Fwill begin a separate 24-hour strike   
OL,13,Ffollowing the weekend, as part of the  
OL,14,Fsame dispute.                          
OL,16,FThe British Medical Association (BMA)  
OL,17,Frejected a recommended 3.5% pay rise   
OL,18,Fand wants to restore the value of      
OL,19,Fdoctors' pay to 2008 levels.           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
