OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CFormer journalist and Lost Lives       
OL,5,Cauthor David McKittrick dies           
OL,6,GThe renowned journalist and author     
OL,7,GDavid McKittrick has died at the age   
OL,8,Gof 77.                                 
OL,10,FMcKittrick was best known for his work 
OL,11,Fduring the Troubles, and the book Lost 
OL,12,FLives.                                 
OL,14,FThe book detailed the people who died  
OL,15,Fas a result of the Troubles.           
OL,17,FIt was first published in 1999 after   
OL,18,Fseveral years of research by           
OL,19,FMcKittrick and co-authors Seamus       
OL,20,FKelters, Brian Feeney and Chris        
OL,21,FThornton.                              
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
